<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">LLM-Based Information Extraction to Support Scientific Literature
Research and Publication Workflows <span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Published in TPDL 2025, New Trends in Theory and Practice of Digital Libraries, Communications in Computer and Information Science, vol 2694. DOI <a href="https:/doi.org/10.1007/978-3-032-06136-2_9" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">10.1007/978-3-032-06136-2_9</a>. This PDF is the author-prepared camera-ready version corresponding to the accepted manuscript and supersedes the submitted version that was inadvertently published as the version of record.</span></span></span></h1>
